      "message_id_md5": null,
      "in_reply_to": null,
      "content_type": "text/html",
      "body": "<p>Hi, I'm Nicole Braun,</p>\n<p>I'm an example user here to show you what a ticket can look like.</p>\n<p>A ticket displays the full conversation of a request, made up of articles. Articles are messages or notes shown in tickets like this one. You can reply and add any information needed to help close the request.</p>\n<p>Explore these links for more insight into Zammad:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://admin-docs.zammad.org/en/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://admin-docs.zammad.org/en/latest\">Zammad Admin Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://user-docs.zammad.org/en/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://user-docs.zammad.org/en/latest\">Zammad User Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://support.zammad.com/help\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://support.zammad.com/help\">Zammad Knowledge Base</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Feel free to use this ticket to explore and get comfortable with Zammad.</p>\n<p>You can even reply to me—I'm looking forward to hearing from you. 👋</p>\n<p>And don't forget, our friendly team is always <a href=\"https://zammad.com/en/company/contact\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://zammad.com/en/company/contact\">happy to help</a> with any questions.</p>\n<p>Have fun! 🚀<br>Nicole Braun</p>",
